<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-ARGENTINA BEAT CHILE 2-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINA BEAT CHILE 2-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>COCHABAMBA, Bolivia 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina beat</p>
<p>Chile 2-0 (halftime 0-0) in a Copa America first round group A</p>
<p>match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Sergio Berti (85), Marcelo Gallardo (87)</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Argentina	2  1  1  0  2  0   4</p>
<p> Ecuador	  2  1  1  0  2  0   4</p>
<p> Paraguay	 2  1  0  1  1  2   3</p>
<p> Chile	    2  0  0  2  0  3   0</p>
<p>Note: top two teams in each group plus the two best</p>
<p>third-best teams qualify for the quarter-finals.</p>
</text>
